--- CLASSIFIER REPLAY on the same live capture ---
Note: "pre-change classifier (before narrowing)" is the previous PUBLISHED head's classifier
(the content of 7a49c661, rebased onto current main). It already carries the Grok approval-title
feature, so it already reads the live ROUNDED capture as empty; the narrowing commit does not
change the rounded family. What the narrowing removes is the unproven light / heavy / double
families that the previous published head still accepted as empty. That before/after difference is
proven by the separate terminal-interface transcript in this directory
(light/heavy/double: empty/allow -> unknown/defer).
